{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18090","headline":"宿曾江口示侄孙湘二首 一 · 韩愈","name":"宿曾江口示侄孙湘二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云昏水奔流，天水漭相围。\n三江灭无口，其谁识涯圻。\n暮宿投民村，高处水半扉。\n犬鸡俱上屋，不复走与飞。\n篙舟入其家，暝闻屋中唏。\n问知岁常然，哀此爲生微。\n海风吹寒晴，波扬衆星辉。\n仰视北斗高，不知路所归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}